찾기 위해 길을 나선다.  그가 향한 곳에는 무엇이 있을까?  라스베가스, 말리부, 춘천, 평창, 샌프란시스코, 도쿄, 서울 다시 한번 꿈을 찾아 떠나는 여정, 그리고 그곳에서 만난 사람들 SUGA, Road to MUSIC Road to D-DAY","tagline":"지금 현재 내가 하고 싶은 이야기를 찾고 싶어요"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u2fkIhqMEUdoHeKIKym8yJ4W3p3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oKj7hdlTey31vvEXfy7YdJASOly.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1106732,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ko-KR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Hm3ZcFKjP0rm9GHshNx2MSw892.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Hm3ZcFKjP0rm9GHshNx2MSw892.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Hm3ZcFKjP0rm9GHshNx2MSw892.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Hm3ZcFKjP0rm9GHshNx2MSw892.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/geET1K0tJfqSTX7fMigYXQADcwv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/geET1K0tJfqSTX7fMigYXQADcwv.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"ko":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u2fkIhqMEUdoHeKIKym8yJ4W3p3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u2fkIhqMEUdoHeKIKym8yJ4W3p3.jpg","language":"ko","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u2fkIhqMEUdoHeKIKym8yJ4W3p3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u2fkIhqMEUdoHeKIKym8yJ4W3p3.jpg","language":"ko","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ri4EF2U9sDiQl5qGH4IxrrjIY5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ri4EF2U9sDiQl5qGH4IxrrjIY5.jpg","language":"ko","width":2000,"height":3000},{"ty